### **Manifesto Headers**
**I. The Myth of Symbolic Transfer**  
*"Language isn't transmittedâ€”it's reenacted under mutual constraints. When you 'understand' this sentence, your cortex is performing token-to-gesture decompression against my phonologized thought fragments."*

**II. Intelligence as Duct Tape**  
*"Planning is what happens when layered constraints (anatomical, ecological, architectural) generate residual coherence. A squirrel's nut stash and Claude's haiku are equally emergentâ€”neither contains a 'plan' until an observer projects one."*

